      <activity id="2c42589c-3056-5a0d-9760-7ba92fa96574" activityNameId="d3dc0f26-356f-5d3d-b4d1-c9eacf82f3fb" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Methanol, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Methanol, at regional storage
Transport from oversea and European methanol plants to Switzerland.;
CAS number: 000067-56-1; 
Formula: CH3OH; 
Synonyms: methyl alcohol, methyl hydroxide, monohydroxymethane; 
UUID: 2dd8974d-9d0a-3975-a37d-62105f3a1bf3
Raw materials, average transport to Switzerland, emissions to air from tank storage, estimation for storage infrastructure.
Location: Data for distances from production places to Switzerland estimated with actual plant capacityes. Data for import releated to whole Europe. Imports data for Europe applied for Switzerland. Similar overseas distances assumed.
Technology: Assumed that 40% of the methanol origins from overseas. Additional 13% from Noway also including tanker transport. Other production within continetal Europe.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Representativity of the assumed transport distances and the used modal split was not determined.  
Extrapolations: &lt;null&gt;
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2dd8974d-9d0a-3975-a37d-62105f3a1bf3.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="fdab769f-4bdb-5024-8349-c1745bbb2597" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
